{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51699","headline":"评僧道二门论难 · 牛峤","name":"评僧道二门论难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄门清净等空门，虔奉天尊与世尊。\n金口说经十二部，玉皇留教五千言。\n鳌头宫殿波澜阔，鹫岭香花梦相存。\n莫向人间争胜负，须知三教本同源。\n（《监诫录》六《旌论衡》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}